Package: a3-motion-ui
Version: 0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Rafjagger
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, x11-utils, x11-xserver-utils, python3
Recommends: onboard, dbus-bin, i3
Description: A3 Motion UI, the touch surface of the A3 Motion controller
 Records and plays movement trajectories for four channels and sends
 them to A3 Core over OSC; it renders no audio. Runs as the systemd user
 unit a3-motion.service on i3 workspace 1; the panel is found by its USB ID.
 .
 User data stays when the package is removed or purged: settings, skins
 and the pattern library in ~/.local/share/a3-motion, the log in
 ~/.local/state/a3-motion. The shipped defaults in /usr/share/a3-motion-ui
 are copied there at the start, never moved or written over: a file you
 changed stays, and a newer shipped version goes beside it as
 <name>.shipped.
